Create a premium mobile-adapted login design with a brand visual area, clean form, and prominent Sign In button. Do not include a public Create Account link on the Admin login page.

Authenticate against the real backend. Verify Admin permissions server-side.

### Customer login options

Show:

- Continue as Guest.
- Continue with Google.
- Continue with Facebook.
- Continue with X (formerly Twitter).

Google, Facebook, and X login must remain visible but unavailable until each provider has been genuinely configured and tested.

For each unconfigured provider:
