Use explicit configuration flags such as GOOGLE_LOGIN_ENABLED=false, FACEBOOK_LOGIN_ENABLED=false, and X_LOGIN_ENABLED=false in the appropriate secure configuration architecture.

Do not place provider secrets inside the APK. When providers are enabled later, implement their real supported authentication flows, callback configuration, backend token verification, and account linking.

### Guest ordering

Guest checkout must work now, even when all social providers are disabled.

Never require social login or account creation merely to browse the menu or place an order.

